{% fold %}
*Clarity* begins with a ticking clock that’s joined by a gentle melody and female vocalist LiZ. Midway through the track, it explodes into a house-inflected, pulsating heater that segues into the staccato, Baltimore club music-influenced “Shave It Up.” OneRepublic vocalist Ryan Tedder injects some falsetto-brushed soul into the synth-dappled “Lost at Sea,” while “Fall Into the Sky” welcomes Ellie Goulding into the fold for a hyperactive workout.

天才制作人 Zedd 对电子乐的兴趣源于法国电音乐队 Justice。他自 2010 年开始制作电音，两年后发布首张专辑《Clarity》。Zedd 将从小受到的古典乐熏陶、Justice 在混音制作上带来的启发，以及对电子混音的尝试和探索融于其中，顺势打入主流乐坛。Zedd 向来擅长为音乐增添奇异色彩，就像在歌曲《Follow You Down》中，Bright Lights 用她略带沙哑的嗓音缓缓吟唱，与合成器的欢快节拍相结合而出的迷幻效应；与英国歌手 Foxes 合作的同名单曲《Clarity》更荣获第 56 届格莱美最佳舞曲，以疑问句展现出恋人面对注定失败的关系时的义无反顾；另一首与 Matthew Koma 合作的单曲《Spectrum》不仅风靡欧美，还通过韩国 SM 娱乐旗下组合的翻唱流行亚洲。其实早在专辑发行前几年，这位年轻的制作人便已为 The Black Eyed Peas、Lady Gaga 等多位大咖的歌曲进行混音制作，出众的音乐才华让当时仅 20 岁出头的 Zedd 迅速成为电音领域的后起之秀。

* Deluxe Edition

This German EDM producer built a buzz on the strength of his DJ skills and high-energy remixes—for everyone from Lady Gaga and The Black Eyed Peas to Skrillex and Swedish House Mafia. ZEDD's debut album, *Clarity*, begins with a ticking clock that’s joined by a gentle melody and female vocalist LiZ—but don’t let the tranquil opening of “Hourglass” fool you. Midway through the track, it explodes into a house-inflected, pulsating heater that segues into the staccato, Baltimore club music-influenced “Shave It Up.” OneRepublic vocalist Ryan Tedder injects some falsetto-brushed soul into the synth-dappled “Lost at Sea,” while “Fall Into the Sky” welcomes Ellie Goulding into the fold for a hyperactive workout. Just when you’ve been stirred up, ZEDD promises to “Follow You Down” with a shimmering appearance by Bright Lights. The frenetic collection comes full circle as the final, aptly titled tune “Epos” concludes with a ticking clock winding down.
{% endfold %}

