预告第六张专辑《LOOM》时，Imagine Dragons 在网站上推出神秘预告，四扇门中有三扇上锁，等待着“信徒”“战士”和“梦想家”来开启。Imagine Dragons 一路以来专辑中的音乐角色也可以用这三者概括：《Origins》对本真与自我的探寻，《Mercury - Act 1》面向死亡与悲痛的经历，《Mercury - Act 2》在曲折中向阳前行的心态。也正是这些，铸就了乐队在《LOOM》中如信徒、战士、梦想家般的勇者之心。

Imagine Dragons 在主题呈现上无所畏惧。Dan Reynolds 标志性的跌宕式唱腔和活泼节奏相结合，为《Take Me to the Beach》带来欢快氛围，副歌还赞美了温暖放松的海滩假日，不细看歌词也许不会发现，歌曲还涉及了国家对民众无处不在的监视等敏感话题。“濒临死亡，再涅槃重生“（Killed and resurrected），《EyesNBSClosed》高歌在炼狱绝境中勇往直前的战士精神，哥伦比亚歌手 J Balvin 在合作版中则贡献了震撼人心的西语演绎。

《LOOM》由 Imagine Dragons 及其长期合作伙伴 Mattman 和 Robin 制作，致力将流行摇滚兼融 Hip-Hop 与电子的张力无限延伸，用高亢的副歌带来更有冲击力的能量。乐队在不同的极端之间灵活游走，时而轻松活泼，时而紧张激烈。这捉摸不透的走向，正如专辑封面上半入地平线的太阳那样，似是日出又是日落，上下哪面是倒影，开始与结束、真实与虚幻，难以说清，一切皆有可能。

On LOOM, Imagine Dragons’ sixth LP, Dan Reynolds and his band weave dexterously between poles. The album is playful at times but intense during others, building from the act’s signature pop-rock style to incorporate more elements of rap and electro than ever before. On LOOM, they also reckon with their own legacy, noting how the project simultaneously marks the end of one era and the beginning of something new.

On “Take Me to the Beach,” Reynolds infuses his signature melodic delivery with a hopping pace, giving the song a gleeful edge even as he digs into hot-button issues like the surveillance state that surrounds us. The chorus extols the virtues of a warm, relaxing day on a sandy hideaway, but Reynolds uses the refrain as an opportunity to dig at his personality: “You take the snow/It’s way too cold/My heart is cold enough,” he sings. It’s funny, but the vocalist grimaces as he chuckles.
